  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://github.com/debdutdeb/matrix-spec/blob/a17550648cc4d96bf79ed21103fe30503e1a0fae/content/application-service-api.md?plain=1#L210-L212\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n\r\nSpec says endpoint was added in 1.7, in reality even the unstable proposal implementation was in 1.10 - [unstable](https://github.com/element-hq/synapse/commit/b0a0fb5c97449720c679045f1bb5a5f393b1c267), later [stable](https://github.com/element-hq/synapse/commit/86d541f37c1bc9197a6f561b31f3aa359740b4bd)\r\n\r\n**Expected behaviour**\r\n\r\n- mention the correct implementation version for the endpoint correctly in spec\r\n- or backport change to 1.7\r\n\r\nI feel like `#1` is more realistic and easier. As it hasn't been fixed, I think it's safe to assume nobody tried it on 1.7 yet, and simultaneously been so upset or blocked to the version that demanded a backport.",
